[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500100_01_0010","text":"——啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500100_01_0020","text":"……？\n甜花，怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500100_01_0030","text":"啊，嗯……\n那边的，游戏厅……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500100_01_0040","text":"恶魔太郎被……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500100_01_0050","text":"嗯……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500100_01_0060","text":"恶魔太郎被……\n囚禁了……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500100_01_0070","text":"……！\n是、是吗……那可不得了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500100_01_0080","text":"……不过，救出恶魔太郎还是下次再说吧\n今天得赶去录音室才行呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500100_01_0090","text":"啊呜……\n说、说得也是呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500100_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31500100_01_0100","text":"（等着我哦，恶魔太郎——！）"}]
